                <pb facs="0509" n="411" sameAs="frus:frus1900/pg411"/>

                <head><hi rendition="#italic">Mr. Hart to Mr.
                            Hay.</hi></head>
                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Telegram.—Paraphrase.]</seg></opener>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Legation of the United States,<lb/>Bogotá</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1900-09-12"><hi rendition="#italic">September
                                12, 1900</hi></date>.</dateline></opener>
                <p>(Mr. Hart reports that it is probable the provisional government of the
                    Vice-President will be sustained; and that the Government announces that the
                    Liberal revolution is ended, only guerrillas remaining.)</p>
            </div>
